# builder-has? for a key that was never set returns Bool(false).
# The builder is created fresh and finished without ever setting "key",
# so builder-has? correctly returns false (not an error).
[call [fn [let b]
  [call [fn [let _]
    [builder-has? "key" b]]
   [builder-finish b]]]
 [make-builder]]
=== out
Bool(false)
